message.content:
{ 
"description": "The creature is shown in right-facing profile walking on a plain light background. It has a stout, arched quadrupedal body with a pale pink, smooth-skinned head and underside and a back, sides, top of the head, outer limbs and dorsal tail densely covered in large overlapping brown scales. The head is broad and flat with a blunt snout, large dark eyes with pale irises, and a slight upturned mouth. Six pink feathery external gills protrude from the sides and top of the neck just behind the head. The four limbs are thick and columnar, pale and wrinkled on the inner and ventral surfaces, scaled on the outer surfaces, ending in broad clawed feet. A thick tapering tail extends to the left rear, pale below and scaled above, partially out of frame. The overall appearance combines a scaled armored back with a soft amphibian-like head, belly and limbs.",
"parts": [
  {
    "part": "head",
    "looks_like": "pale pink, smooth and slightly translucent with wrinkled skin on the throat, broad and flattened with a blunt rounded snout, large protruding eyes with dark pupils and light blue-grey irises, small nostrils, and a faint smile-like mouth line; speckled with tiny dark dots around the eyes and cheeks",
    "where": "at the front right end of the body, facing right"
  },
  {
    "part": "gills",
    "looks_like": "six pink, fleshy stalks with dense feathery red-pink filaments along their length, three on each side of the neck, branching outward and upward",
    "where": "arising from the sides and top of the neck immediately behind the head"
  },
  {
    "part": "scales",
    "looks_like": "large, overlapping, rounded keratinous plates in dark to medium brown with lighter tan edges and fine concentric ridges, arranged in diagonal rows",
    "where": "covering the entire dorsal back from neck to tail, the top of the head between the gills, and the outer upper surfaces of all four legs and the dorsal surface of the tail"
  },
  {
    "part": "legs",
    "looks_like": "stout, columnar limbs with pale pink wrinkled skin on the inner and ventral sides and brown scales on the outer sides, thick at the top tapering to the feet",
    "where": "four limbs positioned under the body, two forelegs under the chest and two hindlegs under the belly, supporting the body above the ground"
  },
  {
    "part": "feet",
    "looks_like": "broad, fleshy pale pink feet with five short toes each bearing a short blunt light tan claw, skin wrinkled and textured",
    "where": "at the distal end of each of the four legs, in contact with the ground"
  },
  {
    "part": "tail",
    "looks_like": "thick at the base and tapering, pale pink wrinkled skin on the ventral side with overlapping brown scales continuing from the back onto the dorsal side",
    "where": "at the rear left end of the body, extending leftward and partially out of the image"
  },
  {
    "part": "markings",
    "looks_like": "small scattered dark brown speckles on the pale skin",
    "where": "on the head around the eyes and cheeks and on the throat"
  }
],
